{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/SatiricalSociety/posts/lastest-tweets-of-kunal-kamra-/815313504462224/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/SatiricalSociety/posts/lastest-tweets-of-kunal-kamra-/815313504462224/","title":"The Satirical Society","description":"Lastest Tweets of Kunal Kamra 👀","language":"en","text":"All reactions:\n\n650 comments\n\n366 shares\n\nLike\n\nComment\n\nMost relevant\n\n\n\nSwarup Biswas\n\nWearing a T-Shirt with own photo on it , is an achievement for this lallu\n\n56\n\nView all 11 replies\n\nSayyid Jabir\n\nWhy sanghis get pissed off when they see his T-shirt\n\n35\n\nView all 32 replies\n\nDhiraj Kumar Singh\n\nR- Rahul\n\nS- Soniya\n\nS- Supriya (legendary spoke person)\n\n29\n\nRamesh Kumar\n\nKunal kamra best comedian of India\n\n37\n\nView all 2 replies\n\nSaurabh Saini\n\nOhhh see....he is having his pic on his own T-Shirt.\n\n15\n\nView all 7 replies\n\nMehr Sethi\n\nU nailed it…super osm t-shirt\n\n2\n\nRabi Karmakar\n\nOpposition is one thing, but when people keep opposing something and eventually realize that it is far above them and cannot be stopped, they get frustrated and start doing wrong things on their own.\n\n4\n\nView all 2 replies\n\nShantaneel Halder\n\nIt's not at a comedy club because he is waiting for a Congress ticket instead of selling those for his show!\n\n47\n\nView all 10 replies\n\nKaran Chopra\n\nBro got paid from his masters to wear that tee\n\n6\n\nView all 4 replies","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":2326.1272239906248,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}